&lt;h2 id="key-features"&gt;Key Features:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wireless display accessible from mobile or laptop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built-in WiFi network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clean and minimal UI/UX&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Machine-hosted web interface&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="engineering-challenge"&gt;Engineering Challenge:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Web interface must be fully self-contained with no external libraries due to internet restrictions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extremely small UI footprint required because of limited memory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controller must host the network, serve the web app, and handle motion control simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
